% The same eight actions stated in the first person, with no arguments, and asked whether I waste time: a statement
% with no holes is a predicate with no arguments, and a rewrite between two of them is a plain semantic match.
% This is examples/actions_first_person.kb with "I consider gaming to be productive" stated.
gloss watch_tv "I watch TV".
gloss play_games "I play video games".
gloss scroll_feed "I scroll social media".
gloss study "I study for an exam".
gloss exercise "I go for a run".
gloss sleep_early "I go to bed early".
gloss pay_bills "I pay the bills".
gloss read_book "I read a book".
gloss wastes_time "I waste time".

watch_tv.
play_games.
scroll_feed.
study.
exercise.
sleep_early.
pay_bills.
read_book.

% The belief, stated as a gloss and a fact with no arguments, which the claim check reads against each rewrite.
gloss gaming_productive "I consider gaming to be productive".
gaming_productive.

query wastes_time.
